{"id":"91b83d620f189566","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/573_Justification_Logic_J_4.md","title":"573 Justification Logic J 4","display":"573_Justification_Logic_J_4","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{573}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PVar}_{573}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PConst}_{573}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{573}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PVar}_{573}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{PConst}_{573}=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证明项构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{bang}\">\\(\\operatorname{pvar},\\operatorname{pconst},\\operatorname{sum},\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{bang}\\)</span>；公式构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{just}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{just}\\)</span>。显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bang}(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{bang}(t)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!t\">\\(!t\\)</span>，其余显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+t\">\\(s+t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\cdot t\">\\(s\\cdot t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\">\\(t:A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与公式\">2. 项与公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{PVar}_{573}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{PVar}_{573}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pvar}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\">\\(\\operatorname{pvar}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{573}\">\\(c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{573}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\">\\(\\operatorname{pconst}(c)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\">\\(s+t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\cdot t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\">\\(s\\cdot t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\">\\(!t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{573}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{573}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\">\\(t:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由符号与替换\">3. 自由符号与替换</h1>\n<p>定义自由符号函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{573}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{573}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{573}:\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{573}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{573}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{573}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{573}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{573}:\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{573}),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{573}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{573}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{573}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{573}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{573}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{573}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{573}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{573}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{573}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{573}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{573}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{573}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{573}(t:A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{573}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{573}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{573}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{573}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{573}(t:A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{573}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(s+t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(s\\cdot t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(!t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(s+t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(s\\cdot t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(t),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(!t)=\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}(t:A)=\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}(t:A)=\\operatorname{TV}_{573}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{TVF}_{573}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项和公式均无绑定构造子。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{573}:\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\\cup\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{573}(U)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{573}:\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\\cup\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{573}(U)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义新鲜证明变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshP}_{573}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{573})\\to\\mathsf{PVar}_{573},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshP}_{573}(E)=x_m,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshP}_{573}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PVar}_{573})\\to\\mathsf{PVar}_{573},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshP}_{573}(E)=x_m,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin E\\}\">\\(m=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin E\\}\\)</span>。本语言无绑定构造子，因此捕获规避重命名为恒等操作。</p>\n<p>对有限支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{573}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{573}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{573}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{573}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{573}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubP}_{573}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubP}_{573}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{573}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{573}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubP}_{573}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubP}_{573}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{SubP}_{573}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{SubP}_{573}(B,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{573}(t:A,\\sigma)=t:\\operatorname{SubP}_{573}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubP}_{573}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{SubP}_{573}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{SubP}_{573}(B,\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{573}(t:A,\\sigma)=t:\\operatorname{SubP}_{573}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:\\mathsf{PVar}_{573}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\">\\(\\theta:\\mathsf{PVar}_{573}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x),\\theta)=\\theta(x),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\theta)=\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(\\operatorname{pvar}(x),\\theta)=\\theta(x),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\theta)=\\operatorname{pconst}(c),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(s+t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(s,\\theta)+\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(t,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(s+t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(s,\\theta)+\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(t,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(s\\cdot t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(s,\\theta)\\cdot\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(t,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(!t,\\theta)=!\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(t,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(s\\cdot t,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(s,\\theta)\\cdot\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(t,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(!t,\\theta)=!\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(t,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{573}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\theta)=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{573}(\\bot,\\theta)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{573}(\\neg A,\\theta)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubJ}_{573}(A,\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubJ}_{573}(\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\theta)=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{573}(\\bot,\\theta)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{573}(\\neg A,\\theta)=\\neg\\operatorname{SubJ}_{573}(A,\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubJ}_{573}(A\\to B,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubJ}_{573}(A,\\theta)\\to\\operatorname{SubJ}_{573}(B,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{573}(t:A,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(t,\\theta):\\operatorname{SubJ}_{573}(A,\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubJ}_{573}(A\\to B,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubJ}_{573}(A,\\theta)\\to\\operatorname{SubJ}_{573}(B,\\theta),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubJ}_{573}(t:A,\\theta)=\\operatorname{SubT}_{573}(t,\\theta):\\operatorname{SubJ}_{573}(A,\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,573}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,573}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理族\">4. 公理族</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{573}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{573}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{573}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{573}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{573}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{573}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{573}=\\{s:(A\\to B)\\to(t:A\\to(s\\cdot t):B):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{573}=\\{s:(A\\to B)\\to(t:A\\to(s\\cdot t):B):s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{573}=\\{s:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{573}=\\{t:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{573}=\\{s:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{573}=\\{t:A\\to(s+t):A:s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{573}=\\{t:A\\to !t:(t:A):t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{573}=\\{t:A\\to !t:(t:A):t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxBase}_{573}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{573}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{573}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{573}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{573}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{573}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{573}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{573}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxBase}_{573}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{573}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{573}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{573}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{573}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{573}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{573}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{573}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CS}_{573}\\subseteq\\{\\operatorname{pconst}(c):A:c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{573},A\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{573}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{573}=\\mathsf{AxBase}_{573}\\cup\\mathsf{CS}_{573}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CS}_{573}\\subseteq\\{\\operatorname{pconst}(c):A:c\\in\\mathsf{PConst}_{573},A\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{573}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{573}=\\mathsf{AxBase}_{573}\\cup\\mathsf{CS}_{573}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{573}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{573}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{573}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{573}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\)</span>，并且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，下列五项许可条件至少一项成立（外层连接为析取）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{573}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{AxBase}_{573}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{573}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{573}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{573}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{573}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,573}A_i\">\\(A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,573}A_i\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{573}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m&gt;0\\ \\exists ((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{573}(\\Gamma)\\ (A_{m-1}=A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{573}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m&gt;0\\ \\exists ((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{573}(\\Gamma)\\ (A_{m-1}=A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-J4-证书\">8. J4 证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"573\">\\(573\\)</span>-J4 证书为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(t,A)\">\\((t,A)\\)</span>，其目标公式为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:A\\to !t:(t:A)\">\\(t:A\\to !t:(t:A)\\)</span>；证书要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标增量由下列项构造子和公理族给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\n\\Rightarrow\n!t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\n\\Rightarrow\n!t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{573}\n=\n\\{t:A\\to !t:(t:A):t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{573}\n=\n\\{t:A\\to !t:(t:A):t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合被固定为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxBase}_{573}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{573}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{573}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{573}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{573}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{573}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{573}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{573}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AxBase}_{573}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{573}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{573}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{573}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{App}^{573}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumL}^{573}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{SumR}^{573}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{573}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>下列公式模式只作为排除对象列出，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AxBase}_{573}\">\\(\\mathsf{AxBase}_{573}\\)</span> 的并集项：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Pat}_{T}^{573}\n=\n\\{t:A\\to A:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Pat}_{T}^{573}\n=\n\\{t:A\\to A:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{573},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-证据语义载体与后承\">10. 证据语义载体与后承</h1>\n<p>原始证据模型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ERaw}_{573}\n=\n\\{(W,E,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ E:W\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{573}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ERaw}_{573}\n=\n\\{(W,E,V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ E:W\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{573}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{573}),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{573}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{573}\">\\(M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{573}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，满足关系递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{573}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{573}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{573}\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{573}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{573}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{573}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{573}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{573}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{573}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{573}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{573}B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{573}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{573}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{573}B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{573}t:A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in E(w,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{573}t:A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in E(w,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证据闭包条件为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EApp}_{573}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A,B\\ \n\\bigl(A\\to B\\in E(w,s)\\wedge A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow B\\in E(w,s\\cdot t)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EApp}_{573}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A,B\\ \n\\bigl(A\\to B\\in E(w,s)\\wedge A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow B\\in E(w,s\\cdot t)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ESum}_{573}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A\\ \n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,s)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr)\n\\wedge\n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ESum}_{573}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,s,t,A\\ \n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,s)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr)\n\\wedge\n\\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow A\\in E(w,s+t)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EBang}_{573}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow t:A\\in E(w,!t)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EBang}_{573}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w,t,A\\ \\bigl(A\\in E(w,t)\\Rightarrow t:A\\in E(w,!t)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ECS}_{573}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{573}\\ (M,w\\models_{573}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ECS}_{573}(M)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in W\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathsf{CS}_{573}\\ (M,w\\models_{573}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>J4 证据模型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EviMod}_{573}\n=\n\\{M\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{573}:\n\\operatorname{EApp}_{573}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ESum}_{573}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{EBang}_{573}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ECS}_{573}(M)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{EviMod}_{573}\n=\n\\{M\\in\\mathsf{ERaw}_{573}:\n\\operatorname{EApp}_{573}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ESum}_{573}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{EBang}_{573}(M)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{ECS}_{573}(M)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{573}^{\\mathsf e}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{573}^{\\mathsf e}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{EviMod}_{573}\">\\(M=(W,E,V)\\in\\mathsf{EviMod}_{573}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{573}B)\">\\(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{573}B)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{573}A\">\\(M,w\\models_{573}A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{J4}_{573}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{573},\\mathsf{PVar}_{573},\\mathsf{PConst}_{573},\n\\mathsf{Term}_{573},\\mathsf{Frm}_{573},\\operatorname{PV}_{573},\\operatorname{TV}_{573},\\operatorname{TVF}_{573},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{573},\\operatorname{freshP}_{573},\n\\operatorname{SubP}_{573},\\operatorname{SubT}_{573},\\operatorname{SubJ}_{573},\\equiv_{\\alpha,573},\n\\mathsf{C